@ cases.where-clause
parses = true
source = ```nib
fn max<A: shared>(a: A, b: A) -> A where Ord(A) { a }
fn get<K, V>(&m: Map(K, V), &k: K) -> V ! {missing} where DecEq(K), Hash(K) { m }
```

